From: x1xhlol <lucknitelol@proton.me>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 21:23:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] wasm: Add SIMD128 motion compensation functions

mc_luma, get_ref, mc_chroma, avg, weight/offsetadd/offsetsub, copy,
hpel_filter, frame_init_lowres_core and the chroma (de)interleaving
functions, 8-bit only.

Explicit weights reach 255 for chroma, so the weighted pixels are
computed as unsigned 16-bit values and saturated before the signed
offset is added, which keeps the result identical to the C version.
